                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "755af2aa-14ad-3602-ab93-c449b9849240",
                        "entry_id": "e25cdaae-7a39-303f-a7d7-cb2232a24a31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. уменьш. к репей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff83a859-4378-429c-80d1-3013e7776ed3",
                                "sense_id": "755af2aa-14ad-3602-ab93-c449b9849240",
                                "text": "Старик страшный, в волосах репейки, лежит головой на кирпиче."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "359cbe1a-ad37-328f-ae89-1c19088a307a",
                        "entry_id": "e25cdaae-7a39-303f-a7d7-cb2232a24a31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор., воен. звездообразное колёсико кавалерийской шпоры"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ba93a2e-1792-4319-b9dc-2fb257f62d8d",
                                "sense_id": "359cbe1a-ad37-328f-ae89-1c19088a307a",
                                "text": "— Прошу не шутить, — посоветовал жандарм, дергая ногою, — репеек его шпоры задел за ковер под креслом, Климу захотелось сказать об этом офицеру, но он промолчал, опасаясь, что Иноков поймет вежливость как угодливость."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16819702-0fe0-3e9c-a363-cacb5dd11582",
                        "entry_id": "e25cdaae-7a39-303f-a7d7-cb2232a24a31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор., воен. воинский знак отличия в виде выпуклой овальной пластины, крепящейся спереди на шапке или кивере"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cef08c9-6a82-3f63-9371-6ce5638b2eb3",
                        "entry_id": "e25cdaae-7a39-303f-a7d7-cb2232a24a31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. металлическая (обычно фигурная) пластина, которая прикрепляется к стенке самовара и в которую врезается кран"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7cb66f9-3a75-4e0d-89b0-aa9d228b0035",
                        "source_entry_id": "e25cdaae-7a39-303f-a7d7-cb2232a24a31",
                        "source_sense_description": "деталь шпоры",
                        "target_lang_word": "rowel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rowel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ebb8427b-b7dc-36b4-8686-5fa98ecc4023",
                                        "entry_id": "f8c3b159-938e-329d-aae9-bd0a6b66caab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The small spiked wheel on the end of a spur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb3334e4-9580-483b-a126-7260b103e71c",
                                                "sense_id": "ebb8427b-b7dc-36b4-8686-5fa98ecc4023",
                                                "text": "The deep and sharp rowels with which Ivanhoe’s heels were now armed, began to make the worthy Prior repent of his courtesy,[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40ed35cc-a714-4fd5-8982-493032f8d732",
                                                "sense_id": "ebb8427b-b7dc-36b4-8686-5fa98ecc4023",
                                                "text": "The dry desert of my native land, her men grey and gaunt, their spines twisted, their feet shod with rowel and spur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93c2c423-6783-42de-bf12-bbebc31100ac",
                                                "sense_id": "ebb8427b-b7dc-36b4-8686-5fa98ecc4023",
                                                "text": "The Lone Ranger will storm in at the head of a posse, rowels tearing blood from the stallion’s white hide, to find his young friend, innocent Dan, swinging from a tree limb by a broken neck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55258904-8271-4eec-b4a0-314dc783f75d",
                                                "sense_id": "ebb8427b-b7dc-36b4-8686-5fa98ecc4023",
                                                "text": "He nodded at the Americans. Buena suerte, he said. He put the long rowels of his spurs to the horse and they moved on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "921eb0a0-d68a-34f6-a5fd-90d990babaad",
                                        "entry_id": "f8c3b159-938e-329d-aae9-bd0a6b66caab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A little flat ring or wheel on a horse's bit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36295953-3f60-4152-a48a-06a4894c9746",
                                                "sense_id": "921eb0a0-d68a-34f6-a5fd-90d990babaad",
                                                "text": "1590, Edmund Spenser, The Faerie Queene, Book 1: Knight of the Red Cross, 1850, Edmund Spenser's Knight of the Red Cross; or Holiness, page 74,\nThe iron rowels into frothy foam he bit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36d45c6b-ed73-3bb4-a880-ce2596b9c769",
                                        "entry_id": "f8c3b159-938e-329d-aae9-bd0a6b66caab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A roll of hair, silk, etc., passed through the flesh of a horse in the manner of a seton in human surgery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rowel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35167bdc-4720-390e-9138-476724de392b",
